My dead president's worth:

Regarding the party scenario -- (davisd, X-Message-Number: #94-1-286) -- as
this thread mutates....

>Suppose we are at a party. A small circle develops around PersonX.
>She begins to discuss personal issues. Joe finds it uninteresting,
